ContractDelta AU adapts the source material by selecting privacy-minimised fields,
normalising values and dates, calculating field-level differences, ordering releases,
and adding evidence hashes and explanatory text. These transformations are independent
and are not official Department of Finance records or calculations.

Records in the private data repository, public fixtures, generated deployment data, and
generated evidence bundles remain subject to the source Creative Commons licence. They are
not relicensed under the repository's MIT Licence. The MIT Licence applies to the original
application source code and project documentation.

ContractDelta AU is an independent project and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the Australian Government.
